  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Slice pumpkin and red onion into thin wedges.\n• Place pumpkin and onion on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil. Sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cb06d4e23d84550740c6/step-81035000.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop cucumber and roasted almonds.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes.\n• Thinly slice apple into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cb06d4e23d84550740c6/step-d71a1710.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large bowl, combine tomatoes, cucumber, apple, spinach & rocket mix, basil pesto and a drizzle of vinegar. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cb06d4e23d84550740c6/step-9388d020.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide basil pesto salad between bowls.\n• Top with roast pumpkin and onion.\n• Sprinkle with almonds and crumble over marinated goat cheese to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a58cb06d4e23d84550740c6/step-9d1e5130.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
